When concurrent CC sessions need to coordinate (e.g., one running tests
while another is editing code), use a shared message folder:

- Drop a markdown file in `~/Documents/<your-comms-dir>/` named `from-<source>_to-<target>_<topic>.md`
- Sessions surface new comms on prompt submission via a UserPromptSubmit hook
- (Hook scaffolding example in `clayworks-lite/hooks/examples/userpromptsubmit.sh`)

